---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import TableNumber from "../components/react/TableNumber.jsx";
import Schedule from "../components/marinecorps/Schedule.astro";

import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import cmcFlag from "../../assets/CMC Flag.png";
import cmcSignature from "../../assets/CMC Signature.png";

import { EVENT } from "../lib/event.js";
import { url } from "../lib/url.js";
import { BUTTON_SECONDARY } from "../lib/ui.js";
---

<Layout title="Your table">
  <script>
    import { celebrate } from "../lib/celebrate.js";
    celebrate(new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get("name") || "");
  </script>

  <TableNumber client:only="react" />

  <div class="mt-16">
    <Schedule />
  </div>

  <article
    class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-2xl px-5"
    aria-labelledby="cmc-message"
  >
    <div class="divider">
      <span class="text-gold-muted" aria-hidden="true">◆</span>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-md overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-2xl shadow-black/50">
      <Image
        src={cmcFlag}
        alt="Flag of the Commandant of the Marine Corps"
        class="h-auto w-full"
        widths={[400, 800]}
        sizes="(min-width: 480px) 448px, 100vw"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-ink-800/60 px-6 py-10 sm:px-12">
      <p class="text-center text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-gold-soft">
        {EVENT.messageDate}
      </p>
      <h2
        id="cmc-message"
        class="mt-3 text-center font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-white text-balance sm:text-3xl"
      >
        A Message from the Commandant of the Marine Corps
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 font-serif text-xl leading-relaxed text-slate-200 sm:text-[1.35rem]">
        <p class="first-letter:float-left first-letter:mr-2 first-letter:font-serif first-letter:text-6xl first-letter:font-bold first-letter:leading-[0.85] first-letter:text-gold">
          For 251 years, the United States Marine Corps has been our Nation's
          premier expeditionary force in readiness. Born from the sea and forged
          in the fires of conflict, Marines have fought, and won, in battles all
          over the world. From our first amphibious landing 250 years ago at
          Nassau to the volcanic sands of Iwo Jima, and from the bold invasion of
          Inchon to the mountains of Afghanistan, we have always marched forward
          with rifles in hand. The Marines who came before us paved our legacy in
          sweat and blood. They built a foundation of excellence and proved time
          and again that Marines remain ready to answer the call.
        </p>
        <p>
          As we reflect on our proud and illustrious history and commemorate the
          founding of our Corps, we must take inspiration for the future. We are
          marching forward, as we always have, to fight and win our Nation's
          battles in every clime and place. We're preparing every day by
          innovating and evolving. Through our ingenuity, ruthless adherence to
          standards, and sheer grit, we continue to demonstrate the unmatched
          lethality of our expeditionary naval forces.
        </p>
        <p>
          Today, the operational demand for Marines is high. At this very hour,
          40,000 Marines are forward deployed and stationed around the world to
          secure liberty and to strike when our adversaries test our resolve.
          Just as always, Marines are ready to go wherever the Nation needs us,
          whenever it needs us.
        </p>
        <p>
          Sergeant Major Ruiz and I could not be prouder of your dedication to
          upholding our legacy as America's Soldiers of the Sea. This is who we
          are, and we are up to the challenge. We are honored to stand beside you
          as we prepare for the fights ahead. Happy 251st Birthday, Marines!
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-10 text-center font-serif text-xl italic text-slate-300">Semper Fidelis,</p>
      <div class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-[16rem] opacity-90">
        <Image
          src={cmcSignature}
          alt="Signature of the Commandant"
          class="h-auto w-full"
        />
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-center text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-slate-400">
        General, U.S. Marine Corps<br />Commandant of the Marine Corps
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <section
    class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-3xl px-5"
    aria-labelledby="video-title"
  >
    <h2
      id="video-title"
      class="text-center font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-3xl"
    >
      The {EVENT.ordinal} Marine Corps Birthday Message
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-xl text-center text-sm text-slate-400">
      Gen. Eric M. Smith and Sgt. Maj. Carlos A. Ruiz deliver this year's
      birthday message from Marine Corps Base Hawaii.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6 aspect-video overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-black shadow-2xl shadow-black/50">
      <iframe
        class="h-full w-full"
        src="https://www.dvidshub.net/video/embed/1028302"
        title={`The ${EVENT.ordinal} Marine Corps Birthday Message (video)`}
        loading="lazy"
        scrolling="no"
        allow="autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; fullscreen"
        allowfullscreen
      ></iframe>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-3 text-center text-sm">
      <a
        class="text-gold-soft underline-offset-4 hover:underline"
        href="https://www.dvidshub.net/video/1028302/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch on DVIDS</a
      >
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="mt-14 flex justify-center px-5">
    <a
      id="back-to-search"
      class={BUTTON_SECONDARY}
      href={url()}
    >
      Back to search
    </a>
  </div>
  <script>
    import { withKey } from "../lib/attendees.js";
    const back = document.getElementById("back-to-search");
    back.href = withKey(back.getAttribute("href"));
  </script>
</Layout>
